---

<Base title="Psychiatric Medication Management in CT | Hopewell" description="Psychiatric evaluations and medication management for children, teens and adults in Glastonbury, Westbrook and nearby CT towns, in person or telehealth." image="/Assets/hhs-2026/westbrook-therapy-office.webp">
  <Header />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(svc)} />
  <main class="hw" data-pgx>
    <ServiceHero
      crumbs={[{ label: "Programs", href: "/programs/" }, { label: "Medication Management" }]}
      title="Psychiatric Medication Management in Connecticut"
      lede="Thoughtful, collaborative psychiatric care for children, teens and adults at six offices from Glastonbury to Westbrook, and by telehealth."
      bullets={heroUsps}
      facts={[{ icon: "star", text: "4.8 · 368 Google reviews" }, { icon: "pin", text: "All six CT offices" }]}
      image="/Assets/evaluation-session.webp"
      imagePos="center 40%"
    >
      <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#b9cbe0">Clinically reviewed by <a class="inl" href="/provider/kristine-a-schlichting-ph-d/">Kristine Schlichting, PhD</a></p>
    </ServiceHero>
    <!-- 2. As featured in -->
    <Creds />


    <!-- 4. Who it's for -->
    <Split heading="What is medication management?">
      <MedCycle slot="media" />
      <p class="pg-lede"><strong>Psychiatric care, built around you.</strong> Medication management is <a class='inl' href='/post/what-is-medication-management-a-comprehensive-guide-to-effective-treatment/'>ongoing psychiatric care</a> that meets each person where they are.</p>
      <CheckList icon="check" items={[
        "A thorough evaluation and an accurate diagnosis",
        "A personalized medication plan, with regular follow-ups to fine-tune it as you go",
        "Providers specifically trained in psychiatric diagnoses, treatments, and medications",
        "Essential care for promoting mental health and preventing things from getting worse",
        "Keep your current therapist, <a class='inl' href='/programs/counseling/'>work with one of ours</a>, or skip therapy altogether, it’s your call"
      ]} />
      <ReadMore id="fold-med">
        <p>Medication management is ongoing psychiatric care, a thorough evaluation, an accurate diagnosis, a personalized medication plan, and regular follow-ups to fine-tune it as you go. It’s essential care for promoting mental health, preventing things from getting worse, and meeting each person where they are. And we don’t put limits on your care.</p>
      </ReadMore>
    </Split>
    <Prose blocks={whoBlocks.slice(0, 1)} startTone={1} />
    <section class="section is-mist">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>Psychiatric care for a wide range of concerns</h2><p class="lede">What we treat.</p></div>
        <ul class="pg-mods c3">
          {treats.map((c) => <li><span class="pg-mod-icon"><Icon name={c.icon} class="h-5 w-5" /></span><span set:html={c.t} /></li>)}
        </ul>
        <p class="sec-foot">Explore how we treat <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/anxiety/">anxiety</a>, <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/depression/">depression</a>, <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/adhd/">ADHD</a>, <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/ocd/">OCD</a> &amp; <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/trauma-ptsd/">trauma</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. What treatment includes -->
    <Split heading="Assessment, therapy &amp; meds in one visit" reverse tone="stone">
      <MedOneVisit slot="media" />
      <p class="pg-lede"><strong>Less runaround, more progress.</strong> Most practices make you bounce between a prescriber and a therapist. At Hopewell Health Solutions, you can get assessment, talk therapy, and medication in a single visit.</p>
      <CheckList icon="check" items={[
        "Often a same-day appointment",
        "Care for ages 4 and up: children, <a class='inl' href='/programs/teen-iop/'>teens</a>, and adults",
        "Kids who need <a class='inl' href='/treatment-methods/adhd-testing/'>ADHD evaluation</a> and <a class='inl' href='/what-we-treat/adhd/'>support</a>",
        "Starting medication for the first time, or your longtime psychiatrist is retiring",
        "<strong>Your care, your choice:</strong> keep your therapist, <a class='inl' href='/programs/counseling/'>work with ours</a>, or medication-only"
      ]} />
      <ReadMore id="fold-onevisit">
        <p>We care for ages 4 and up, children, teens, and adults, including kids who need ADHD evaluation and support. Whether you’re starting medication for the first time or your longtime psychiatrist is retiring, we’ll build a plan you’re comfortable with.</p>
      </ReadMore>
    </Split>
    <Prose blocks={whoBlocks.slice(1, 2)} startTone={0} />
    <section class="section is-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>What medication management includes</h2><p class="lede">How it works.</p></div>
        <ol class="pg-steps">
          {howItWorks.map(([t, d], i) => <li><span class="n">{i + 1}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></li>)}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section is-white" style="padding-top:0">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="pg-band">
          <span class="pg-band-icon"><Icon name="dna" class="h-9 w-9" /></span>
          <div>
            <h2>Find the right fit faster with GeneSight®</h2>
            <p><strong style="color:#fff">Precision prescribing.</strong> When it helps, we use GeneSight® pharmacogenomic testing, a simple cheek swab that shows how your body is likely to respond to different medications. Instead of trial-and-error, we use your biology to find the right fit faster.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/treatment-methods/genesight-testing/" class="btn btn-ghost">Learn about GeneSight® testing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <IconCards heading="Connected to a full continuum of care" lede="More than medication. Medication is one tool, not the whole toolbox. When it’s the right fit, we connect your care to:" items={moreThanMed} cols={3} />
    <IconCards heading="Why people choose us for psychiatric care" lede="Why families choose Hopewell." items={unique} tone="stone" />
    <Quote text="Providers who make sure you “leave with zero questions.”" cite="From a Google review of our medication management care" img={P + "south-glastonbury-waiting-room.webp"} />

    <!-- 6. Team, by location -->
    <Team heading="Our Psychiatric Providers" lede="Board-certified psychiatric nurse practitioners and physician assistants." slugs={["tracy-sibley-pmhnp-bc-aprn", "christina-lindsay-pmhnp-bc-aprn", "linda-scillia-pmhnp-bc-aprn", "katrin-moskowitz-dnp-pmhnp-bc-fnp", "ana-arroyo-aprn-pmhnp-bc", "chris-patenaude-pa", "katherine-salvador-pa-c"]} tone="white" />
    <Prose blocks={whoBlocks.slice(2)} startTone={1} />

    <!-- 7. Testimonials -->
    <VideoCarousel videos={stories} mode="grid" tone="navy" heading="Client Stories, in Their Own Words" lede="Clients share what care at Hopewell was like. Hear more on the <a class='inl' href='/podcast/'>Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast</a>." link={{ href: "/testimonials/", label: "Read more patient stories" }} />

    <!-- 8. Locations -->
    <Locations heading="Medication Management at All Six Offices" lede="In person at <a class='inl' href='/locations/'>six Connecticut offices</a>, plus virtual visits statewide. Reach us at <a class='inl' href='tel:8607351448'>(860) 735-1448</a> · Fax (860) 781-8588 · <a class='inl' href='mailto:hhs4help@gmail.com'>hhs4help@gmail.com</a>." />

    <!-- 9. Insurance -->
    <Insurance heading="Insurance for psychiatry visits" lede="Most commercial plans cover psychiatric evaluations and medication management. Our team verifies your benefits at no cost, before you commit to anything. Hopewell doesn’t accept Medicare or Medicaid." />

    <!-- Reviews sit last, right above the FAQ (coordinator, 2026-11-16) -->

    <!-- 10. FAQ -->
    <Reviews tone="stone" heading="What Our Clients Say" first={["Medication management"]} />
    <Faq faqs={faqs} heading="Psychiatry &amp; medication management, common questions" tone="white" />

    <!-- 11. Related + final CTA -->
    <OtherPrograms current="/programs/medication-management/" />
    <FinalCta heading="Take control of your mental health" lede="With a provider who listens and a plan that fits, psychiatric care can feel like a relief instead of a chore. Reach out to Hopewell Health Solutions today, confidentially, with no pressure." />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
